# P0 / P1 / P2 pretrainings of small_C: small_RC without the row steps (encoder col_v1_small)
# (rriva, 2026-11-26).  The model is the base config: CONFIG=saint_small_C.
# Same recipe for every model of this experiment:
#   40 epochs, batch 12800, AdamW lr 1e-3, gradient clip 1.0 (arm=pretrain), contrastive T 0.1, noise lambda 0.4,
#   no dropout; WSD: warmup 2 epochs, constant, decay over epochs 32-40; no early stopping, downstream loads last.ckpt.
#   p0 = per-object contrastive on the track and jet-feature embeddings (the aggregator is not trained)
#   p1 = p0 + jet contrastive (weight 1.0, T 0.1) on the aggregator output
#   p2 = jet contrastive only (per-object contrastive weight 0)
# Seeds 42 424 4242 42424 (owner, 2026-11-26).
# Two runs per card (SLOTS_PER_GPU=2).  small_C does a subset of small_RC's work, so small_RC's measurements
# (stage P_small_RC_20261126_123135, first epochs, two per card on L40S) bound it:
#   @mem = small_RC's GPU peak + margin: P0 16.6 -> 17, P1 22.5 -> 23, P2 15.3 -> 16 GiB (never two P1 on a card);
#   @est = small_RC's slowest shared epoch (P1 next to P2, 5460 s) x 1.56 (A40 vs L40S) = 8520 -> 9000 s.
# (The CPU estimate of experiments/dev/2026-11-26_cpu-mem-estimate was 1.5-1.9x too low: not used.)
# Launched 2026-11-26 23:15 (stage P_small_C_20261126_231531), 2 packs (a third when a job slot frees: STAGE_DIR=<stage> PACKS=1 bash slurm/ssl_pack.sh):
#   CONFIG=saint_small_C MAX_EPOCHS=40 SEEDS="42 424 4242 42424" WALLTIME=7-00:00:00 EST_SECONDS_PER_EPOCH=9000 \
#   GPU_NODE=gpu-L40S-open,gpu-A40 STAGE=P_small_C PACKS=2 SLOTS_PER_GPU=2 GPU_BUDGET_GIB=40 MEM_PER_GPU_GB=48 \
#   CELLS=experiments/2026-11_pretrain-saint-small/configs/P_small_C.cells bash slurm/ssl_pack.sh
p0_small_C  arm=pretrain chunk_size=512 datamodule.batch_size=12800 optimizer.lr=1e-3 optimizer.schedule=wsd optimizer.warmup_epochs=2 optimizer.decay_frac=0.2 ~callbacks.early_stopping @est=9000 @mem=17
p1_small_C  arm=pretrain chunk_size=512 datamodule.batch_size=12800 optimizer.lr=1e-3 optimizer.schedule=wsd optimizer.warmup_epochs=2 optimizer.decay_frac=0.2 ~callbacks.early_stopping pretrain.loss_weights.jet_contrastive=1.0 @est=9000 @mem=23
p2_small_C  arm=pretrain chunk_size=512 datamodule.batch_size=12800 optimizer.lr=1e-3 optimizer.schedule=wsd optimizer.warmup_epochs=2 optimizer.decay_frac=0.2 ~callbacks.early_stopping pretrain.loss_weights.contrastive=0.0 pretrain.loss_weights.jet_contrastive=1.0 @est=9000 @mem=16
